```
playZoneMusic(force=false) {
 if(!state)return;
 const music=...
 this.musicZone=music;
 this.audio.playMusic(music,{battle:this.musicBattle});
}
```
No need force. But force used after respawn etc. Audio dedupes anyway. Let's do:
```
playZoneMusic() {
 const music...
 this.musicZone=music;
 this.audio.playMusic(music, {battle: this.musicBattle});
}
```
Keep signature force unused? Callers pass true; fine. We'll retain param but ignore.

